        "width": 480,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "## Serve Tech Trends via JSON Webhook for Desktop Widgets (Requires Collector)\n\n### How it works\n\n1. The workflow starts with a webhook trigger for tech trends.\n2. Today's tech trends data is fetched using a data table node.\n3. The data is formatted into JSON using a custom code node.\n4. The formatted JSON response is sent back via webhook.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Set up webhook URL in 'GET /tech-trends-desktop' node\n- [ ] Ensure the 'Get Todays Trends Desktop' node is connected to an appropriate data source\n- [ ] Verify JSON format structure in 'Format Desktop JSON' node\n- [ ] Confirm webhook response parameters in 'Respond with Desktop JSON' node\n\n### Customization\n\nModify 'Format Desktop JSON' to change the JSON structure as needed."
      },
